jellyfin-web 12.4, the web client of Jellyfin, by the Jellyfin contributors.
Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2: see LICENSE.

The Mira image contains jellyfin-web 12.4, unmodified, as a separate
program, in /usr/share/mira/jellyfin-web: its built files, copied from
the official jellyfin/jellyfin:12.4 image. Its complete source code is
attached to every Mira release on GitHub, as
jellyfin-web-12.4-source.tar.gz, and is also at
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-web/tree/v12.4

Mira is a separate program, released under the MIT License. It serves
these files at /web/ and adds to the page one script of its own,
/web/mira.js, which is under Mira's license.
